# Mole Man, Moloid Master: three Moxen pay for it on turn 1. Playing Marsh Flats and cracking it for a Swamp are two
# lands entering, so two Moloid tokens. On turn 3 Bot1 plays the Marsh Flats back from the graveyard (a third
# Moloid), then attacks with the first Moloid, whose attack trigger offers a mill that Bot1 accepts.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mole Man, Moloid Master
Marsh Flats
Mountain
Mountain
Swamp
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mole Man, Moloid Master.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Marsh Flats.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Marsh Flats.Activate
Bot1.Search(Swamp)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Graveyard.Marsh Flats.Play
[T3 Bot1.Attackers]
Bot1.Attack(Moloid > Bot2)
Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 9
Bot1.Battlefield.Moloid#1.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Mountain
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
